Z||000007||operator64||08-14-2001||08:17 AM||||   Monkeyman,<BR>  Go to this site <A HREF="http://www.etrucker.com" TARGET=_blank>www.etrucker.com</A>  . There is a chat room within and all the folks in there are either people on the road or spouces of those on the road, they should be able to give you all kinds of information.<BR>   Before i quit driving 6 months ago there was a service called PNV ( park and view ) you could get cable, telephone, and internet service right in your truck in most major T-stops. Stop by the link above and hopefully someone can help you out more with what you are looking for.<BR>         Operator||||reg||1
